:name: HawkHealth Group (STM32F767) — local dev
:description: Watch your group build's output on USART3, using your locally built firmware.
#
# ZERO EDITS NEEDED — launch Renode FROM YOUR CLONE ROOT (the folder with firmware/ platforms/):
#     cd <your-clone>
#     renode renode/hawkhealth-local.resc
# then at the (hawkhealth) monitor prompt:  start
#
# Rebuilt the firmware?  At the prompt:
#     Reset
#     sysbus LoadELF @firmware/hawkhealth.elf
#     start
#
using sysbus
mach create "hawkhealth"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/hawkhealth_f767.repl
sysbus LoadELF @firmware/hawkhealth.elf
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart3
